# (build 166) LANGUAGE changed with the C menu open: every window on the
# screen built again in the new language (win_language_changed), its
# cursor kept -- the main menu, the party list, Rolf's items. Until 166
# the open windows kept the old language until they were opened again,
# and a run of his face left drawn in another language's was blank.
start level $64 33 10
party 4 50
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
shot 00_english
language retranslation
wait ticks 2
expect pixel 32 16 $EEE        # the top of his I of Items
shot 01_retranslated
language ja
wait ticks 2
expect pixel 36 30 $EEE        # the dakuten over じ of じょうたい
shot 02_japanese
language us
wait ticks 2
expect pixel 32 16 $800        # paper again: the stock I of ITEM
expect pixel 34 17 $EEE        # starts a row lower
shot 03_english_again
press b
wait idle
expect menu $02
